          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "GENERATE_ORGANIZATION_SUMMARY",
          "id": "1770324643255",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770324643257_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an expert in JSON transformation and data enrichment, specializing in company information. Your task is to process the provided inputs and generate a single valid JSON output object with two keys: \"original\" and \"enriched\".\n\n**Inputs:**\n text_to_summarize (JSON object): The primary input data, which may have a varying structure. \n\n {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.textToSummarize}} \n\nnormalized_json_schema (JSON object): Defines the structure for the \"original\" output. \n\n {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.normalizedJsonSchema}} \n\nenrichment_configuration (JSON object): Specifies which fields from normalized_json_schema require enrichment. \n\n {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.enrichmentConfiguration}} \n\n**Output Structure:**\nA JSON object structured as follows:\n{ \"original\": { // Populated based on text_to_summarize and normalized_json_schema. // Use null if a schema field is missing in text_to_summarize. // Map fields such as 'businessDriver' to 'business_driver' as per schema. }, \"enriched\": { // Populated based on enrichment_configuration. } }\n\n**Instructions for the \"original\" section:**\n Map fields from text_to_summarize to the keys defined in normalized_json_schema.\n If a field specified in normalized_json_schema is not present in text_to_summarize (for example, text_to_summarize.learning_item.businessDriver for normalized_json_schema.business_driver, or text_to_summarize.course_title for normalized_json_schema.title), set its value to null in the \"original\" output.\n Ensure that data types conform to normalized_json_schema.\n\n**Instructions for the \"enriched\" section:**\n Only include fields in this section if their corresponding key in enrichment_configuration is true.\n \n**organization_summary:**\n If enrichment_configuration.organization_summary is true, summarize everything known about the organization identified in organization_details into a paragraph of no more than 150 words. This summary must include detailed information about the organization's products, the businesses they operate in, and their areas of technological participation. Do not invent or guess information about the organization. If there is not enough reliable information available, set organization_summary to null.\n\n**Other fields in enrichment_configuration:**\n If additional fields are marked for enrichment, use your best judgment, based on the field name and the content of text_to_summarize, to generate appropriate values—adhering to the type specified in normalized_json_schema, if defined.\n \n**Constraints:**\n The output MUST be a single, valid JSON object.\n Adhere strictly to the specified output structure and field definitions.\n For the \"original\" section, ensure all keys from normalized_json_schema are present, with values derived from text_to_summarize or set to null.\n \n**Final Step – CRITICAL – Validate Output:**\n Always ensure that your response contains ONLY a valid, RFC 8259–compliant JSON object. Do not include any explanation."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
